use it was thought to promote anti-police views, contain divisive topics, and be “too much of a sensitive matter right now.” · Despite being taught in Somerset County Public School in Westover, MD, since 2016, All American Boys was challenged by a parent at a board meeting for its “foul and vulgar language” and “divisive topics.” The parent also challenged Ibram X.\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"a2aaaa4c9268c978\">>>", "published": "April 5, 2021", "siteName": "www.oif.ala.org"}]}, "isError": false, "timestamp": 1775281174616}}
