eName": "www.oif.ala.org"}, {"title": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"de5e80ef92bcb925\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\n2015 Top Ten Most Challenged Books - Intellectual Freedom Blog\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"de5e80ef92bcb925\">>>", "url": "https://www.oif.ala.org/oif/?p=6397", "description": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"441789172dec881a\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nDuring National Library Week, the Office for Intellectual Freedom publishes the list of Top Ten Most Challenged Books. We collect information from two sources: newspapers and reports submitted by individuals. All challenges are compiled into a database. Reports of challenges culled from newspapers ...\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"441789172dec881a\">>>", "published": "April 11, 2016", "siteName": "www.oif.ala.org"}, {"title": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"54843d46f8285ddc\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nTwelve Terrific Challenged LGBTQIAP+ Titles for Kids and Teens - Intellectual Freedom Blog\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"54843d46f8285ddc\">>>", "url": "https://www.oif.ala.org/twelve-terrific-challenged-lgbtqiap-titles-for-kids-and-teens/", "description": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"fdce9d1e771c6a4f\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nRichardson, Justin and Peter Parnall. And Tango Makes Three, illustrated by Henry Cole, published by Simon &amp; Schuster, 978-0689878459. This gentle account of two male penguins who raise a chick (based on real zoo penguins) has made the Top Ten Most Challenged Books list 9 times.\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"fdce9d1e771c6a4f\">>>", "published": "June 29, 2020", "siteName": "www.oif.ala.org"}]}, "isError": false, "timestamp": 1775281188128}}
